Chapter 1
When I was six years old, I saw a magnificent picture in a book about the jungle.
It was a green snake swallowing a beast and nobody understood it at all.
I copied it in pencil, and tried to make it my own drawing of the snake.

Chapter 2
The boa constrictor had swallowed the beast, and the picture showed him inside.
All my life I had kept that picture, and it was the beginning of my understanding.
It is the story of the little prince that I want to tell you today.
